{"lines": [{"text": "Your phone never talks to GPS satellites.", "start": 0.35, "end": 3.034}, {"text": "It only listens.", "start": 3.284, "end": 4.353}, {"text": "About thirty GPS satellites circle the Earth, more than twelve thousand miles up.", "start": 4.803, "end": 9.767}, {"text": "Each one carries an atomic clock, and keeps broadcasting two things: the exact time, and where it is.", "start": 10.117, "end": 16.404}, {"text": "That signal takes about seven hundredths of a second to reach you.", "start": 16.754, "end": 20.144}, {"text": "Your phone times that delay from at least four satellites, and turns each one into a distance.", "start": 20.494, "end": 25.9}, {"text": "Only one spot on Earth fits every distance.", "start": 26.2, "end": 28.653}, {"text": "That's you. Accurate to about sixteen feet, without ever saying a word.", "start": 28.803, "end": 32.838}], "total": 32.838, "words": [{"w": "Your", "s": 0.35, "e": 0.664, "line": 0}, {"w": "phone", "s": 0.664, "e": 1.035, "line": 0}, {"w": "never", "s": 1.035, "e": 1.406, "line": 0}, {"w": "talks", "s": 1.406, "e": 1.778, "line": 0}, {"w": "to", "s": 1.778, "e": 1.978, "line": 0}, {"w": "GPS", "s": 1.978, "e": 2.235, "line": 0}, {"w": "satellites.", "s": 2.235, "e": 3.034, "line": 0}, {"w": "It", "s": 3.284, "e": 3.471, "line": 1}, {"w": "only", "s": 3.471, "e": 3.765, "line": 1}, {"w": "listens.", "s": 3.765, "e": 4.353, "line": 1}, {"w": "About", "s": 4.803, "e": 5.156, "line": 2}, {"w": "30", "s": 5.156, "e": 5.563, "line": 2}, {"w": "GPS", "s": 5.563, "e": 5.807, "line": 2}, {"w": "satellites", "s": 5.807, "e": 6.431, "line": 2}, {"w": "circle", "s": 6.431, "e": 6.837, "line": 2}, {"w": "the", "s": 6.837, "e": 7.082, "line": 2}, {"w": "Earth,", "s": 7.082, "e": 7.57, "line": 2}, {"w": "more", "s": 7.57, "e": 7.868, "line": 2}, {"w": "than", "s": 7.868, "e": 8.167, "line": 2}, {"w": "12,000", "s": 8.167, "e": 9.089, "line": 2}, {"w": "miles", "s": 9.089, "e": 9.441, "line": 2}, {"w": "up.", "s": 9.441, 